This is an example overlay for KDE plasma (or any other DE/WM that supports layer-shell)
requirements:
    - dont use GNOME
    - wayland
how to use:
    - launch the appimage and then close the overlay
    - a .desktop file will be generated
    - launch the desktop file and you will be prompted for a shortcut permission
    - set your shortcut and confirm
    - use the overlay lol








CMake Qt6 Quick Template
------------------------

You need Qt6 and CMake 3.16 or higher

-- Build instructions --

cd /home/vasik96/projects/info_overlay
mkdir build
cd build
cmake ../
make

src/info_overlay


-- Tutorials and resources --

Qt online docs
https://doc.qt.io/
